{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "ASR検証": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ASR audit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foundation Models": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foundation Models"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foundation Models の文脈長は 8,192 トークン（日本語でおよそ1万文字）です。長い収録はこの単位に分けて順に処理します。大きくすると文脈は広がりますが、上限を超えると失敗します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foundation Models has a context window of 8,192 tokens, roughly 10,000 Japanese characters. Long recordings are split into chunks of this size and processed in order. A larger chunk widens the context but fails once the limit is passed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLM が返せるのは候補の番号だけなので、候補にない文字列が出ることはありません。読みが一致する食い違い（機構と気候など）は音響で区別できないため、文脈による判断が適しています。一方、読みが違う食い違いは音響に情報が残っているので、テキストだけで判断させると、見えない誤りが増えます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model can only return the number of a candidate, so it can never produce a string that was not offered. Where readings match (as with 機構 and 気候) the audio cannot separate them, which makes context the right tool. Where readings differ, the audio still holds the answer, and judging from text alone adds errors you cannot see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLMによる校正を行う": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proofread with a language model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLMに文脈から判定させる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let the model decide from context"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OS内蔵エンジンで下書き。照合も校正もしない。57分の録音で30秒ほど。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drafts with the built-in engine. No cross-check, no proofreading. About 30 seconds for a 57-minute recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "github.com/RTCK-reina/Utsushi": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "github.com/RTCK-reina/Utsushi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mov / mp4 / m4a / mp3 / wav など、AVFoundation が読める形式に対応しています": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports mov, mp4, m4a, mp3, wav and other formats AVFoundation can read"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "whisper で認識し、設定した照合を掛ける。57分の録音で5〜10分": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognizes with whisper and applies the cross-check you configured. 5–10 minutes for a 57-minute recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "whisper と系統の違うエンジンで同じ音声を認識し、出力が食い違う箇所を取り出します。両者が一致していれば信用でき、食い違っていれば怪しい、という判断材料になります。同じ系統のモデルを足しても誤りが相関するだけなので、ここに並ぶのはアーキテクチャの異なるものだけです。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognizes the same audio with an engine of a different lineage and extracts the places where the outputs disagree. Agreement is a reason to trust a passage; disagreement is a reason to look. Adding a model of the same lineage only correlates the errors, so only differing architectures are listed here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「標準」で使うモデル": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model used by Standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いずれも CPU で動きます（静的リンクした onnxruntime では CoreML が使えないためです）。照合を1つ足すごとに、収録時間ぶんの認識がもう一周走ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All of these run on the CPU, because a statically linked onnxruntime cannot use CoreML. Each cross-check engine adds another full pass over the recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ここだけは文脈を手掛かりにします。ただし本文は書き換えません。モデルが返せるのは、行番号、その行にある語、ありうる語の3つだけで、返した語が本文になければ機械的に捨てます。通った場合も本文はそのままで、候補が横に並ぶだけです。同じ指摘が2回出たときだけ採用します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the one place that uses context as evidence. Even so, the transcript is never rewritten. The model may return only a line number, a word on that line, and a word that might belong there; if the word it names is absent from the line, the suggestion is dropped mechanically. When a suggestion passes, the text stays as it was and the candidate is shown alongside it. A suggestion is kept only when it appears twice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ここに登録した語は、2か所で使われます。ひとつは認識時の語彙ヒント（whisper の initial_prompt）で、モデルがその語を知らないことによる誤認識を減らします。もうひとつは、認識後の決定論的な置換です。読み一致ゲートは読みが変わる書き換えを必ず棄却するため、社名や人名のような誤認識を直せる経路は、ここだけになります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words registered here are used in two places. The first is as a vocabulary hint during recognition (whisper's initial_prompt), which reduces errors caused by the model not knowing a word. The second is a deterministic replacement after recognition. Because the reading gate always rejects an edit that changes pronunciation, this is the only route by which a misrecognized company or personal name can be corrected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この版でできること": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About this version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これより小さい音しかない区間は、認識結果が出ていても本文を捨てます。無音に対して文章を出してしまう「幻聴」を止めるための、主な仕組みです。右に寄せるほど幻聴は減りますが、小声のやりとりを落としやすくなります。既定の -45 dBFS 付近から動かす必要は、ふつうありません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spans quieter than this have their text discarded even when the engine produced words. This is the main defence against the model inventing speech in silence. Moving right removes more of it but starts dropping quiet exchanges. There is usually no reason to move away from the default of about -45 dBFS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これらはプロンプトではなくコードで強制されている。緩めるにはソースを変更する必要がある。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are enforced in code, not in the prompt. Relaxing them requires changing the source."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべてのエンジンの出力が一致しました。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All engines produced the same text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべてのセグメントが原文のままです。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every segment is unchanged from the original."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて原文に戻す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revert all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なし": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はっきりした声だけ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear speech only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エンジン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ゲートの内容（変更不可）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gate rules (fixed)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バージョン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ファイルを選ぶ…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a file…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ファイルを開く…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a file…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "モデル": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "モデルには、どの行が重要かを示す行番号と短い見出しだけを返させ、本文は文字起こしからそのまま引用します。要約文をモデルに書かせる経路はありません。見出しは、引用にない数値・英数字・カタカナ語を含む場合に棄却され、代わりに原文の先頭が機械的に切り出されます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model returns only line numbers marking what matters, plus a short headline. The body is quoted from the transcript unchanged; there is no path by which the model writes prose. A headline containing digits, Latin text or katakana absent from the quotation is rejected, and the opening of the source line is used instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "モデルの見出しが検証で落ちたため、原文から機械的に抜き出したもの": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's headline failed verification, so this was taken from the transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ライセンス": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中身の違いはありません。残りは、整列・語尾・表記の違いです。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No substantive differences. The rest are alignment, inflection, and notation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "作者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Author"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全形式をフォルダに書き出す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export every format to a folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再認識で差し替えた区間": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spans replaced by re-recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定対象外": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not judged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判定済み": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Judged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "別のファイル…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another file…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "別エンジンで読み直して食い違いを探す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-read with another engine to find disagreements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "利用可能": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "削除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動画・音声ファイルをここにドロップ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drop a video or audio file here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "区間ごとに、最も文脈に合わない語を1つ選んでいます。誤りのない区間でも1件は出るため、誤りの証拠ではなく確認の手掛かりとしてご覧ください。本文は書き換えていません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One word per span is picked as the least plausible. A span with no errors still yields one, so treat these as prompts to check rather than proof of error. The transcript itself is untouched."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文にない漢語を含む見出しを棄却します。「予算を承認」が「予算を却下」になるような意味の反転を止められますが、実測（11分の素材）では見出し3件が3件とも棄却され、モデル由来の見出しは0%になりました。棄却されると原文の先頭を切り出した見出しに替わるため、引用のすぐ上に同じ文が並びます。切ると言い換えの自由度は戻りますが、反転を止める防壁は数値・英数字・カタカナ語だけになります。要約タブの「モデル見出しが通った割合」で効果を見て決めてください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejects headlines containing Sino-Japanese words absent from the source. This stops reversals of meaning such as \"approve the budget\" becoming \"reject the budget\", but in a measurement over an 11-minute clip all three headlines were rejected and none came from the model. A rejected headline is replaced by the opening of the source line, so the same sentence appears immediately above its own quotation. Turning this off restores freedom to paraphrase, leaving digits, Latin text and katakana as the only guard against reversal. Judge by the share of model headlines that pass, shown in the Summary tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文に戻す": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文に無い英数字トークンの出現は棄却": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejects new alphanumeric tokens absent from the source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取りこぼし疑い区間を自動で再認識する": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-recognize spans suspected of dropped speech"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ提案が2回出た場合のみ採用する": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accept only when the same suggestion appears twice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固有名詞辞書": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proper noun dictionary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実測では、whisper と parakeet の11分の比較で、判定145件のうち138件が読みの不一致でした。読みが違う箇所は音響に情報が残っているため、テキストだけの判断は確度が落ちます。既定では切ってあり、その分は判定せず人の確認に残します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a measured comparison of whisper against parakeet over 11 minutes, 138 of 145 judgements involved differing readings. Where the readings differ, information remains in the audio, so judging from text alone is less reliable. This is off by default, leaving those cases for a person to check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "導入済み": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尤度が低い区間": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low-confidence spans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "情報": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
