          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "無音とみなす音の小ささ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Level below which audio counts as silence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "無音または反復として本文を捨てた区間です。誤って捨てていないかを、ここで確認できます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spans whose text was discarded as silence or repetition. Check here whether anything was dropped by mistake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照合": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cross-check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照合はエンジン間の食い違いしか見られないため、すべてのエンジンが同じ間違え方をした箇所は素通りします。実測でも「期初」が4エンジンすべてで「気象」になり、そのまま出力されていました。音響の多数決では、原理的に拾えない種類の誤りです。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A cross-check can only see where engines disagree, so a passage that every engine got wrong the same way passes straight through. In one measurement all four engines turned 期初 into 気象 and it was published as-is. A majority vote over acoustics cannot catch this class of error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照合エンジン": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cross-check engines"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状態を再確認": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "編集距離 40 超は棄却": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejects edits with a distance above 40"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動判定": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detect automatically"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動判定は、話者が言語を切り替える収録で外しやすい。分かっているなら指定する方が安定する。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic detection often fails when speakers switch languages. Naming the language is more stable when you know it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "英語": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "著作権": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copyright"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要約": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要約を作る": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build a summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見出しの検証を厳しくする": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verify headlines strictly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定の「校正」タブで要約を有効にすると、\\n次回の実行から要点を抜き出します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on summaries in the Proofreading tab\\nto extract key points on the next run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定の「照合」タブで別エンジンを有効にすると、\\n食い違う箇所を洗い出せます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable another engine in the Cross-check tab\\nto surface where the engines disagree."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定（⌘,）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings (⌘,)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "認識エンジンは開始ボタンで選びます。\n\n「高速」は OS 内蔵のエンジンを使います。モデルの取得が要らず、57分の録音を30秒ほどで通しますが、照合も校正も行いません。固有名詞が崩れやすく、辞書による認識の誘導も効かない点にご注意ください。\n\n「標準」は下で選んだ whisper のモデルを使い、照合タブで指定したエンジンで読み直します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recognition engine is chosen by the start button.\n\nFast uses the engine built into macOS. It needs no download and gets through a 57-minute recording in about 30 seconds, but performs no cross-check and no proofreading. Proper nouns break more easily, and the dictionary cannot steer recognition.\n\nStandard uses the whisper model selected below, then re-reads with the engines chosen in the Cross-check tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読みが違う判定は音響情報を使っていないため、確度が落ちます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Judging differing readings ignores the acoustics, so confidence drops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読みが違う食い違いも判定させる（非推奨）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also judge disagreements with different readings (not recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読み（発音）が変わる書き換えは棄却": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejects edits that change the reading"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辞書": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictionary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "追加": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長さ比 0.75〜1.35 の外は棄却": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rejects length ratios outside 0.75–1.35"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "静かでも拾う": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick up quiet speech"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音声の言語": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spoken language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音声はこの Mac の中だけで処理されます。外部に送信されることはありません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio is processed entirely on this Mac. Nothing is sent anywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音声はこの Mac の外に出ません。\n認識・検証・校正・要約のすべてが端末内で動きます。\n\n書き出しの冒頭にも同じバージョンが載ります。\n検証記録の意味はバージョンによって変わることがあるため\n（0.4.1 より前は、反復ループの区間を破棄するだけで読み直していません）、\n出力を後から見返すときはそこを確認してください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio never leaves this Mac.\nRecognition, auditing, proofreading and summarizing all run on device.\n\nThe same version appears at the top of every export.\nBecause the meaning of the audit record can change between versions\n(before 0.4.1, repetition loops were discarded but never re-read),\ncheck it when revisiting an old export."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "食い違いの判定": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Judging disagreements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高速": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fast"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}